 "meta": {
  "title": "EV charging hub: 8 x 22 kW with dynamic load management",
  "project": "EX-40",
  "client": "Example retail car park",
  "author": "uniwire examples",
  
  "lang": "en",
  "notes": [
   "Demonstrates: IEC 60364-7-722 charging point protection: bays 1-4 individual type B RCD + MCB, bays 5-8 type A RCBO with RDC-DD 6 mA DC detection in the station; load management controller reading the incomer meter (data links) and capping the hub at 160 A",
   "Installed 8 x 22 kW = 176 kW; dynamic limit 110 kW (160 A) set in the load manager → incomer Ir 160 A, feeder 4x95 mm² Al",
   "Bays 5-8 cabled in buried ducts (D-duct), bays 1-4 on cable tray (C)"
  ]
 },
